flowchart LR
  CLIENT[Client HTTP] --> HTTP[Adapter HTTP NestJS]
  HTTP --> USECASE[Composant application\nEnrollLearner]
  USECASE --> DOMAIN[Composant domaine\nSession + Enrollment]
  USECASE --> PORTS[Ports sortants application]
  PORTS --> PG[Adapter PostgreSQL]
  PORTS --> TIME[Adapter horloge]
  PORTS --> IDS[Adapter identité]
  PORTS --> NOTIFY[Adapter notification simulée]
  PG --> DB[(PostgreSQL 16)]
  BOOT[Bootstrap NestJS] -. compose .-> HTTP
  BOOT -. compose .-> PG
